[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/2131591760","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2695#issuecomment-2131591760","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695","id":2131591760,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM5_DYJQ","user":{"login":"EdamAme-x","id":121654029,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0BLDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121654029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x","html_url":"https://github.com/EdamAme-x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-25T22:40:51Z","updated_at":"2024-05-25T22:40:51Z","body":"looks no problem...?\r\n```ts\r\n constructor(\r\n    request: Request,\r\n    path: string = '/',\r\n    matchResult: Result<[unknown, RouterRoute]> = [[]]\r\n  ) {\r\n    this.raw = request\r\n    this.path = path\r\n    this.#matchResult = matchResult\r\n    this.#validatedData = {}\r\n  }\r\n```\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n private dispatch(\r\n    request: Request,\r\n    executionCtx: ExecutionContext | FetchEventLike | undefined,\r\n    env: E['Bindings'],\r\n    method: string\r\n  ): Response | Promise<Response> {\r\n    // Handle HEAD method\r\n    if (method === 'HEAD') {\r\n      return (async () =>\r\n        new Response(null, await this.dispatch(request, executionCtx, env, 'GET')))()\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    const path = this.getPath(request, { env })\r\n    const matchResult = this.matchRoute(method, path)\r\n\r\n    const c = new Context(new HonoRequest(request, path, matchResult), {\r\n      env,\r\n      executionCtx,\r\n      notFoundHandler: this.notFoundHandler,\r\n    })\r\n...\r\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/2131591760/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/comments/2131593245","html_url":"https://github.com/honojs/hono/issues/2695#issuecomment-2131593245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/honojs/hono/issues/2695","id":2131593245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOGiE5WM5_DYgd","user":{"login":"EdamAme-x","id":121654029,"node_id":"U_kgDOB0BLDQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121654029?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x","html_url":"https://github.com/EdamAme-x","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EdamAme-x/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-05-25T22:41:47Z","updated_at":"2024-05-25T22:41:47Z","body":"That problem is only in **OpenAPIHono** enviroment?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reac